WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Speaker 1: All right, let's get into audience&nbsp;
questions for the week one day early because of my&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.800
upcoming trip, remember, we're going to have&nbsp;
some great guest hosts upcoming, including&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.080
Faran Cousins from Ring of Fire and Fair&nbsp;
Balance, the eponymous named Fair and Balanced.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.240
Also Jesse Dolma. It's going to be great. It's&nbsp;
going to be absolutely fantastic. But let's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.560
get right into your questions. David, do you&nbsp;
think Joe Biden is really going to try to pass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.120
a national vaccine mandate? The statement so far&nbsp;
from the White House have been confusing. Yeah. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.600
the White House, I think, is being careful.&nbsp;
There's been a couple of times now where White&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.840
House staffers have been asked about, is Biden&nbsp;
investigating? Is Biden planning for is he getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:44.000
advice about a possible vaccine mandate? And the&nbsp;
answer has been a pretty carefully worded that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.960
not something he is looking to do or has any plans&nbsp;
to do at this time. And of course, when I hear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:57.840
that, I don't hear he's eventually going to do&nbsp;
it. I hear he's not ruling it out unconditionally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:02.000
because circumstances may change and it's&nbsp;
conceivable that it makes sense to leave it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.360
on the table. But I actually don't think the Biden&nbsp;
administration is going to even attempt to pass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:15.920
a federal vaccine mandate. However, we've already&nbsp;
talked about the potential legality of state level&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:21.360
vaccine mandates and municipality level vaccine&nbsp;
mandates, and there does seem to be precedent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:26.880
for it. You look at Cambridge, Massachusetts, in&nbsp;
the very early 20th century. I don't remember if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.680
it was ninety five, ninety three. There&nbsp;
was a point where the city of Cambridge&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:38.960
said you must be vaccinated against smallpox.&nbsp;
The vaccine was, quote, experimental at the time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:44.000
much the same way that now the vaccines have&nbsp;
not yet received FDA approval, although they're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:53.920
expected to soon. And so my guess would be that&nbsp;
if Joe Biden wanted to try to force people to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:59.520
vaccinated and again, that doesn't mean someone&nbsp;
shows up and holds you down. My guess is that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:03.760
it would be some kind of requirement would,&nbsp;
I don't know, maybe a fine attached to it or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:07.520
something. Even saying it doesn't really make any&nbsp;
sense, because I don't think it's going to happen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:15.600
I think the way Biden would do it is he would push&nbsp;
for governors or municipalities to mandate it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:24.080
which seems much more based in precedent, at&nbsp;
least from a legal standpoint. Now, I'll go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:30.240
even further. I don't know that we're really&nbsp;
going to see that because I I think accurately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:38.400
it's seen as likely political suicide for whoever&nbsp;
tries to do it. I think even in blue states with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:46.560
Democratic governors, a vaccine mandate could&nbsp;
be a recipe for you lose your next reelection,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:53.280
because I think it would not be well received&nbsp;
by enough people in basically every state&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:00.960
that it could be a really politically disastrous&nbsp;
thing to do. And so more plausible and maybe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:07.120
equally effective is just look at the polling&nbsp;
where people say what would be most likely to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.680
encourage them to get vaccinated. So as an&nbsp;
example, last week I covered this live event&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:17.520
where Joe Biden said, hey, governors, please use&nbsp;
the money we sent you to give one hundred dollars&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:23.680
to everybody who goes and gets a first shot. OK,&nbsp;
a poll was done on that over the weekend, and only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.400
14 percent of Americans who are not interested&nbsp;
in the vaccine said one hundred dollars would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:33.440
change their mind. 14 percent said I don't want&nbsp;
the vaccine, but for 100 bucks, I would go.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:41.920
Contrast that with 41 percent of those who don't&nbsp;
currently want a vaccine, who said if it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:51.120
required to fly, I would go and get vaccinated.&nbsp;
It doesn't take that much thinking to realize Joe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:58.720
Biden and the federal government through the FAA&nbsp;
have a lot of say over what happens on airplanes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:06.080
and would there be a more effective approach than&nbsp;
mandating vaccines are giving people 100 bucks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:13.120
then working through the FAA either to&nbsp;
directly or to encourage airlines to say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:18.480
you must be vaccinated in order to fly with&nbsp;
us? Or at minimum, if you're not vaccinated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:24.400
you have to do a negative test. You could even&nbsp;
I think even that would significantly increase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:28.480
vaccination numbers. Right now, when you fly&nbsp;
domestically, there might be some examples like I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:33.120
know at one point Hawaii was doing something with&nbsp;
testing. Right now, though, to fly domestically,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:38.880
you don't even need to be tested. So you could&nbsp;
even stop short of a vaccine requirement for for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:44.160
aviation, domestic aviation. You could just&nbsp;
say you now have two options. When you fly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:49.520
you either bring proof of vaccination, which I&nbsp;
know some people will say, well, people will start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:53.920
faking those. That's got to be punished. Really,&nbsp;
seriously, really, really seriously. The way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:59.200
Canada punished a couple of Americans for faking&nbsp;
vaccine information, you either give us proof of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:06.160
vaccination or you've got to get a test right here&nbsp;
or within 48, 72, however you figure it out, that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.560
would make a really big dent in those who don't&nbsp;
want to get vaccinated go by. What people are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:16.080
telling you is the point that I'm trying to make.&nbsp;
I don't expect Joe Biden to actually try a federal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:21.360
vaccine mandate. I think if he wants to go in that&nbsp;
direction, it's likely he would say, governors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:27.520
please do this in your states. Of course, if he&nbsp;
did that. The governors that are willing to do it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:32.640
are probably the ones in the states that are&nbsp;
already more vaccinated and less urgently would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:38.400
need to do it, that's always that's sort of a&nbsp;
moral hazard, status quo type of thing. But that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:43.760
the way I see it. Let me know if you see the&nbsp;
likelihood of a Biden vaccine mandate differently.

